DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
16281::$$$message_0128_0000_0000$$$::"I bought it. Umm, was it the no-bake cheese cookie blueberry?"[lr]::
16282::$$$message_0128_0000_0001$$$::"Good work. Yes, [wvl][se volume=80 storage=se218.wav][shock vmax=10 time=400 count=4]here you go."[lr]::
16283::$$$message_0128_0000_0002$$$::As Caster takes the triangular wrapped crepe without even looking back, she nonchalantly gives me a 500 yen coin.::
16284::$$$message_0128_0001_0000$$$::"Uh... That's not enough. You still owe me eighty yen."[lr]::
16285::$$$message_0128_0001_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
16286::$$$message_0128_0001_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Hey.[font italic=false][lr]::
16287::$$$message_0128_0001_0003$$$::It's useless. She doesn't hear me.::
16288::$$$message_0128_0002_0000$$$::I have no other choice but to gobble down on mine.[lr]::
16289::$$$message_0128_0002_0001$$$::I got the store clerk's recommendation, banana caramel chocolate whipped cream.[lr]::
16290::$$$message_0128_0002_0002$$$::...It's good. This is really good.[lr]::
16291::$$$message_0128_0002_0003$$$::Even if I take away the fact that I'm hungry, this is exquisite.[lr]::
16292::$$$message_0128_0002_0004$$$::It doesn't have an excessively long name for nothing. So the crepes nowadays taste this luxurious, huh?::
16293::$$$message_0128_0003_0000$$$::I remembered once I got in line at the stand, but it was a pretty popular store. I think Sakura was talking about it before too.[lr]::
16294::$$$message_0128_0003_0001$$$::But despite seeming to have an absurd amount of calories, it doesn't make me full at all. It's like hell for Sakura.::
16295::$$$message_0128_0004_0000$$$::"...All right."[lr]::
16296::$$$message_0128_0004_0001$$$::Caster on the other hand hurls it down her throat as if the taste doesn't matter, crumples up the packaging, and throws it over her shoulder.::
16297::$$$message_0128_0005_0000$$$::"Ugh..."[lr]::
16298::$$$message_0128_0005_0001$$$::I sigh and catch it.[lr]::
16299::$$$message_0128_0005_0002$$$::And make a rebound shot that the trash can would admire.[lr]::
16300::$$$message_0128_0005_0003$$$::Clinging to a parked minivan, her eyes are discreetly fixed in the direction of two people walking together.::
16301::$$$message_0128_0006_0000$$$::One is Caster's husband of few words, Souichirou Kuzuki.[lr]::
16302::$$$message_0128_0006_0001$$$::The other is our unfaithful big sister figure, Taiga Fujimura.[lr]::
16303::$$$message_0128_0006_0002$$$::They would be colleagues... Right? Yeah.::
16304::$$$message_0128_0007_0000$$$::On my way to Ryudou Temple to meet Issei, I got captured by this witch and have been walking around town for about an hour and a half, standing him up.[lr]::
16305::$$$message_0128_0007_0001$$$::Issei is probably furious right now.::
16306::$$$message_0128_0008_0000$$$::Before I realized it, we went through Miyama and are in the middle of Shinto.::
16307::$$$message_0128_0009_0000$$$::When we crossed the big bridge, we hid from pillar to pillar on the road while getting honked at by trucks.[lr]::
16308::$$$message_0128_0009_0001$$$::Those two still haven't noticed us even after that, so I can only think that there's some magecraft at work.[lr]::
16309::$$$message_0128_0009_0002$$$::So it's true that love makes you blind.::
16310::$$$message_0128_0010_0000$$$::[font italic=true]...Hmm?[font italic=false][lr]::
16311::$$$message_0128_0010_0001$$$::[font italic=true]Why does something feel off?[font italic=false][lr]::
16312::$$$message_0128_0010_0002$$$::For the sake of argument, let's assume that she's just a "girl" in love.::
16313::$$$message_0128_0011_0000$$$::We match the movement of the subjects we're stalking and also move forward.[lr]::
16314::$$$message_0128_0011_0001$$$::I tap on Caster's shoulder as we stand in the shadow of the bus stop's information board.::
16315::$$$message_0128_0012_0000$$$::"Hey, Caster?[lr]::
16316::$$$message_0128_0012_0001$$$::I still haven't really grasped the main point of this pursuit..."[lr]::
16317::$$$message_0128_0012_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
16318::$$$message_0128_0012_0003$$$::There's no response.::
16319::$$$message_0128_0013_0000$$$::"...Hey, Caster."[lr]::
16320::$$$message_0128_0013_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
16321::$$$message_0128_0013_0002$$$::Still no response.::
16322::$$$message_0128_0014_0000$$$::"Hey, Casko."[lr]::
16323::$$$message_0128_0014_0001$$$::[font italic=true]...Hrrk!!![font italic=false][lr]::
16324::$$$message_0128_0014_0002$$$::[shock vmax=20 time=200 count=-3]Her heel! [wshock canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=300][shock vmax=20 time=200 count=-3]Her high heels! [wshock canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=300][shock vmax=20 time=200 count=-3]Right on! [wshock canskip=0][wait canskip=0 time=300][shock vmax=20 time=200 count=-3]My shin!::
16325::$$$message_0128_0015_0000$$$::[stophaze time=400][font italic=1]"...M-Madam?[rf] (falsetto voice)[lr]::
16326::$$$message_0128_0015_0001$$$::[font italic=1]M-Mrs. Young Wife in a denim bolero jacket?"[rf][lr]::
16327::$$$message_0128_0015_0002$$$::"Oh, did you say something?"::
16328::$$$message_0128_0016_0000$$$::"Umm... Can you remind me why we're getting so into stalking them this much?"[lr]::
16329::$$$message_0128_0016_0001$$$::"[delay speed=180]This much?[delay speed=user]"[rf][lr]::
16330::$$$message_0128_0016_0002$$$::She grabs my collar and pulls me into the shadow of the sculpture in the square. A blue fire is lit in her eyes.::
16331::$$$message_0128_0017_0000$$$::"You don't have a very good memory, do you? It should be obvious.[lr]::
16332::$$$message_0128_0017_0001$$$::We're keeping an eye on that adulteress. To make sure that no misfortune or mistake falls upon Souichirou's safety!"[lr]::
16333::$$$message_0128_0017_0002$$$::That's the part I don't get the most.::
16334::$$$message_0128_0018_0000$$$::"Um, but, you know. The one there is Taiga Fujimura."[lr]::
16335::$$$message_0128_0018_0001$$$::"Yes.[lr]::
16336::$$$message_0128_0018_0002$$$::Isn't that why I have you here as her guardian to monitor her?"::
16337::$$$message_0128_0019_0000$$$::Guardian, monitor... Is Fuji-nee a criminal?[lr]::
16338::$$$message_0128_0019_0001$$$::Well, I don't feel like denying it in the sense that I am taking care of her.[lr]::
16339::$$$message_0128_0019_0002$$$::That's not the problem...::
16340::$$$message_0128_0020_0000$$$::"The one next to her is Mr. Kuzuki, right?"[lr]::
16341::$$$message_0128_0020_0001$$$::"That is indeed Souichirou."[lr]::
16342::$$$message_0128_0020_0002$$$::"...Um, what is the 'misfortune or mistake' that will fall upon him?"[lr]::
16343::$$$message_0128_0020_0003$$$::"How foolish. Obviously, I was talking about the completely natural situation that would happen if a man and woman were together.[lr]::
16344::$$$message_0128_0020_0004$$$::Are you too young to understand, boy?"::
16345::$$$message_0128_0021_0000$$$::"Do you mean[line len=3]"[lr]::
16346::$$$message_0128_0021_0001$$$::"Oh, Souichirou is going inside that building![cacheimage storage=キャスター私服02i(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][se storage=se054.wav][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=キャスター私服02i(近)] Come now, walk!"[lr]::
16347::$$$message_0128_0021_0002$$$::"Ow, ow, ow."::
16348::$$$message_0128_0022_0000$$$::I tiptoe in a crouched position from sculpture to sculpture, Caster still grabbing my collar.::
16349::$$$message_0128_0023_0000$$$::A child with his family that passes by us points at us while laughing.[lr]::
16350::$$$message_0128_0023_0001$$$::"What are you looking at, kid!? I'll turn you into a pig!"[lr]::
16351::$$$message_0128_0023_0002$$$::[font italic=true]Eek...![font italic=false][lr]::
16352::$$$message_0128_0023_0003$$$::[font italic=true]Stop saying those kinds of things with a poker face![font italic=false]::
16353::$$$message_0128_0024_0000$$$::"Wait, hold on, Caster.[lr]::
16354::$$$message_0128_0024_0001$$$::Look. As far as I know, if you asked who the farthest woman from the words 'infidelity investigation' and 'household search' in Fuyuki City[line len=2]no, maybe all of Western Japan[line len=2]is, that would be Miss Taiga Fujimura over there."::
16355::$$$message_0128_0025_0000$$$::"[line len=3]Achoo! [cacheimage storage=葛木01a眼鏡(遠),藤08f(近),o駅前パーク(秋)-(昼)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][rep fliplr=0 tops=46,1 storages=葛木01a眼鏡(遠),藤08f(近) time=300 flipud=0 lefts=88,254 bg=o駅前パーク(秋)-(昼) indexes=1000,2000]Mmm."::
16356::$$$message_0128_0026_0000$$$::"Compared to Fuji-nee, the poster girl at my part-time job would be way more realistic."::
16357::$$$message_0128_0027_0000$$$::"[line len=3]Meowchoo! [cacheimage storage=一成兄01b(遠),ネコ01f(近),i柳洞寺_調理場][wvl canskip=0 time=600][rep textoff=0 fliplr=0 storages=一成兄01b(遠),ネコ01f(近) time=300 flipud=0 poss=l,rc bg=i柳洞寺_調理場 indexes=1000,2000 cleardash=1]Ahh."[lr]::
16358::$$$message_0128_0027_0001$$$::"Oh? Neko, do you have a cold? You should drink at times like these."::
16359::$$$message_0128_0028_0000$$$::"Huh...? That's weird, both are to blame?[lr]::
16360::$$$message_0128_0028_0001$$$::Whatever, anyway that's just how unrealistic it is!"::
16361::$$$message_0128_0029_0000$$$::[line len=3]Although I tried to convince her, Caster doesn't look like she's understood at all.[lr]::
16362::$$$message_0128_0029_0001$$$::"Are you insisting that tigress is harmless?[lr]::
16363::$$$message_0128_0029_0002$$$::However, [wvl][shock vmax=15 time=200 count=-3]that isn't the least bit persuasive when they're over there, flaunting their tryst!"[lr]::
16364::$$$message_0128_0029_0003$$$::"I said that's[line len=3]"::
16365::$$$message_0128_0030_0000$$$::[font italic=true]...Come to think of it, what is Fuji-nee doing?[font italic=false][lr]::
16366::$$$message_0128_0030_0001$$$::I thought she had just wandered off this morning.::
16367::$$$message_0128_0031_0000$$$::"Well, I'm sure it's about work. Like checking out a site."[lr]::
16368::$$$message_0128_0031_0001$$$::"Homurahara High should be off today. Souichirou always tells me when he's working on weekends or working overtime."::
16369::$$$message_0128_0032_0000$$$::"Wow, as expected of newlyweds. That's thoughtful."[lr]::
16370::$$$message_0128_0032_0001$$$::"Yes, exactly.[lr]::
16371::$$$message_0128_0032_0002$$$::He would say, 'I'll be late. Please go ahead and eat first.'"::
16372::$$$message_0128_0033_0000$$$::"Wow. When Fuji-nee works overtime, she just says, 'Shirou! A pork cutlet lunch with extra cabbage, quick!'"[lr]::
16373::$$$message_0128_0033_0001$$$::"I'm jealous...[lr]::
16374::$$$message_0128_0033_0002$$$::I also want to see Souichirou working."::
16375::$$$message_0128_0034_0000$$$::"Souichirou also talks during class, right?"[lr]::
16376::$$$message_0128_0034_0001$$$::"Well yeah, it wouldn't be class if he wasn't talking the whole time."[lr]::
16377::$$$message_0128_0034_0002$$$::"That's nice..."[lr]::
16378::$$$message_0128_0034_0003$$$::"Wait, what is?"[lr]::
16379::$$$message_0128_0034_0004$$$::"That you can listen to his class."::
16380::$$$message_0128_0035_0000$$$::"That must be a happy and sweet time."[lr]::
16381::$$$message_0128_0035_0001$$$::"...Indeed.[lr]::
16382::$$$message_0128_0035_0002$$$::It is an ethics class."::
16383::$$$message_0128_0036_0000$$$::Sure enough, Mr. Kuzuki must not talk as much at home.[lr]::
16384::$$$message_0128_0036_0001$$$::Caster must not be unhappy with that, but wanting to hear his voice must be her honest feelings.::
16385::$$$message_0128_0037_0000$$$::"All right. Let's do a rehearsal.[lr]::
16386::$$$message_0128_0037_0001$$$::Let's go greet them like we would in the staff room."[lr]::
16387::$$$message_0128_0037_0002$$$::As I start walking, she pulls my arm back.[lr]::
16388::$$$message_0128_0037_0003$$$::When I look back, Caster is shaking her head left to right.::
16389::$$$message_0128_0038_0000$$$::"N-[wvl][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]No, absolutely not."[lr]::
16390::$$$message_0128_0038_0001$$$::"Why not?"[lr]::
16391::$$$message_0128_0038_0002$$$::"Y-You really don't get it![lr]::
16392::$$$message_0128_0038_0003$$$::Wives are supposed to wait for their husband's return[line len=3]"[lr]::
16393::$$$message_0128_0038_0004$$$::The moment that Caster raises her voice, Mr. Kuzuki turns around.::
16394::$$$message_0128_0039_0000$$$::"Oh, are you allergic to pollen?[lr]::
16395::$$$message_0128_0039_0001$$$::I hear that it's been rough in the autumn lately. I'm totally fine, though."[lr]::
16396::$$$message_0128_0039_0002$$$::"No. I just thought I heard a familiar voice."[lr]::
16397::$$$message_0128_0039_0003$$$::"The more people gossip, the more pollen increases."[lr]::
16398::$$$message_0128_0039_0004$$$::"...[wait canskip=0 time=400][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=葛木01a眼鏡(近)][say storage=cty0404_kuz_0010 name=葛木]Is that an urban legend?"::
16399::$$$message_0128_0040_0000$$$::"Haah... Haah... That was close..."[lr]::
16400::$$$message_0128_0040_0001$$$::"So you are doubting Mr. Kuzuki after all."[lr]::
16401::$$$message_0128_0040_0002$$$::"Guh."[lr]::
16402::$$$message_0128_0040_0003$$$::Caster hides behind a dress that's on display at the clothes store and scrunches her eyebrows.::
16403::$$$message_0128_0041_0000$$$::"Who said such a thing?"[lr]::
16404::$$$message_0128_0041_0001$$$::"So, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]you don't want your husband to know that you're doubting him, [wvl canskip=0 time=400]huh?"[lr]::
16405::$$$message_0128_0041_0002$$$::"...Whatever happened to you? [l][say storage=cty0404_cas_0251 name=キャスター]The boy that I know had a bit more of a lovable and honest personality."::
16406::$$$message_0128_0042_0000$$$::"Does that mean gullible?"[lr]::
16407::$$$message_0128_0042_0001$$$::That's offensive.[lr]::
16408::$$$message_0128_0042_0002$$$::They say that you should pay attention when looking at a boy you haven't seen in three days.::
16409::$$$message_0128_0043_0000$$$::"I've changed.[lr]::
16410::$$$message_0128_0043_0001$$$::After spending time at an estate that's turned into a den of demons because of those schemers, whether I like it or not[line len=2]"[lr]::
16411::$$$message_0128_0043_0002$$$::"What on earth are those two doing?[lr]::
16412::$$$message_0128_0043_0003$$$::Oh, they moved again."[lr]::
16413::$$$message_0128_0043_0004$$$::"Caster?"[lr]::
16414::$$$message_0128_0043_0005$$$::...She's not even listening.[lr]::
16415::$$$message_0128_0043_0006$$$::And she just goes off on her own.::
16416::$$$message_0128_0044_0000$$$::"..."::
16417::$$$message_0128_0045_0000$$$::"...I'm seriously starting to get hungry. I'm going to get going."[lr]::
16418::$$$message_0128_0045_0001$$$::Caster turns around quickly and sinks her claws into my shoulders.::
16419::$$$message_0128_0046_0000$$$::"Wait a minute![lr]::
16420::$$$message_0128_0046_0001$$$::Saber's the only one that can get away with being cute by acting hungry! It's just unsightly when boys do it!"[lr]::
16421::$$$message_0128_0046_0002$$$::"Well, good luck with the rest."[lr]::
16422::$$$message_0128_0046_0003$$$::"...Hrrk![lr]::
16423::$$$message_0128_0046_0004$$$::W-Wait, wait, wait[line len=3]!"::
16424::$$$message_0128_0047_0000$$$::Caster, who is clinging onto the hem of my shirt, slides across the smooth floor like a snow sled.[lr]::
16425::$$$message_0128_0047_0001$$$::I keep on walking without any regard.::
16426::$$$message_0128_0048_0000$$$::"I can understand your worries.[lr]::
16427::$$$message_0128_0048_0001$$$::But it's not a good hobby to follow behind people."[lr]::
16428::$$$message_0128_0048_0002$$$::"Bah... Bah..."[lr]::
16429::$$$message_0128_0048_0003$$$::"...Bah?"[lr]::
16430::$$$message_0128_0048_0004$$$::I get appalled seeing Caster sitting on her knees in tears and finally stop.::
16431::$$$message_0128_0049_0000$$$::"B-But if I follow them by myself[line len=3][lr]::
16432::$$$message_0128_0049_0001$$$::I'll look like a weird person, or a lover that's in love with someone else's husband!"[lr]::
16433::$$$message_0128_0049_0002$$$::"So those are your true feelings.[lr]::
16434::$$$message_0128_0049_0003$$$::...But well, isn't it fine? What's wrong with some questioning? You should just say it without getting embarrassed."[lr]::
16435::$$$message_0128_0049_0004$$$::"...Huh?"::
16436::$$$message_0128_0050_0000$$$::"That you're Medea Kuzuki. That you're genuinely that man's wife[line len=3]like that."[lr]::
16437::$$$message_0128_0050_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
16438::$$$message_0128_0050_0002$$$::Caster, who was in a staggering pose, looks up.::
16439::$$$message_0128_0051_0000$$$::"...C-Can you repeat that again?"[lr]::
16440::$$$message_0128_0051_0001$$$::"Wait... What?"[lr]::
16441::$$$message_0128_0051_0002$$$::English?::
16442::$$$message_0128_0052_0000$$$::"Umm, Medea Kuzuki?"[lr]::
16443::$$$message_0128_0052_0001$$$::"..."::
16444::$$$message_0128_0053_0000$$$::"...Medea... Kuzu...ki..."[delay speed=user]::
16445::$$$message_0128_0054_0000$$$::"T-That's... Good.[lr]::
16446::$$$message_0128_0054_0001$$$::That's it. Yes. Medea Kuzuki!"::
16447::$$$message_0128_0055_0000$$$::"I need to have Assassin carve a nameplate when I get home!"[lr]::
16448::$$$message_0128_0055_0001$$$::"You're a freeloader, though."[lr]::
16449::$$$message_0128_0055_0002$$$::Caster extends her arms out and spins around like a bamboo-copter.::
16450::$$$message_0128_0056_0000$$$::"Everyone! I am![lr]::
16451::$$$message_0128_0056_0001$$$::Medea Kuzuki![lr]::
16452::$$$message_0128_0056_0002$$$::Me[line len=2]de[line len=2]a[line len=2]Kuzu..."[lr]::
16453::$$$message_0128_0056_0003$$$::"Hahaha, you're glowing, Caster."[lr]::
16454::$$$message_0128_0056_0004$$$::Although she's totally being a weird person.[lr]::
16455::$$$message_0128_0056_0005$$$::...But, she's in a pretty panicked state; is she going to blow up like a bomb with one more push?::
16456::$$$message_0128_0057_0000$$$::"Wait. Where is Fuji-nee and Mr. Kuzuki?"[lr]::
16457::$$$message_0128_0057_0001$$$::"Khh, that tigress. She shook me off!"[lr]::
16458::$$$message_0128_0057_0002$$$::"Oh, she's back!"[lr]::
16459::$$$message_0128_0057_0003$$$::"Get down!"::
16460::$$$message_0128_0058_0000$$$::It's pathetic how naturally I can hide at this point.[lr]::
16461::$$$message_0128_0058_0001$$$::The two had just returned from the food court of the shopping mall.::
16462::$$$message_0128_0059_0000$$$::"Sorry for making you walk. You must be mad."[lr]::
16463::$$$message_0128_0059_0001$$$::"I do not mind walking."[lr]::
16464::$$$message_0128_0059_0002$$$::"I'm glad. It's okay.[lr]::
16465::$$$message_0128_0059_0003$$$::We'll get it right next time for sure."::
16466::$$$message_0128_0060_0000$$$::The two walk away from the shopping mall and head out to look for the next location.[lr]::
16467::$$$message_0128_0060_0001$$$::When I look back, all the stores are crowded from it being the weekend during the day.[lr]::
16468::$$$message_0128_0060_0002$$$::But, it's not to the point that they can't sit.::
16469::$$$message_0128_0061_0000$$$::"They've been following this pattern for a while now.[lr]::
16470::$$$message_0128_0061_0001$$$::They come to the front of a store and then turn back. It's not like the stores are closed or anything..."[lr]::
16471::$$$message_0128_0061_0002$$$::"...Oh."::
16472::$$$message_0128_0062_0000$$$::"Boy, that is[line len=3]"[lr]::
16473::$$$message_0128_0062_0001$$$::"I'd like to graduate from 'boy' soon."[lr]::
16474::$$$message_0128_0062_0002$$$::"Then, junior."[lr]::
16475::$$$message_0128_0062_0003$$$::"Junior, huh..."[lr]::
16476::$$$message_0128_0062_0004$$$::At the exit of the Italian chain restaurant.[lr]::
16477::$$$message_0128_0062_0005$$$::In the direction that Caster is pointing, there are three girls in school uniforms.::
16478::$$$message_0128_0063_0000$$$::"It's Saegusa and the others.[lr]::
16479::$$$message_0128_0063_0001$$$::It seems like they're coming back from practice."[lr]::
16480::$$$message_0128_0063_0002$$$::Caster's expression becomes grim.::
16481::$$$message_0128_0064_0000$$$::"...So he is trying to avoid being seen.[lr]::
16482::$$$message_0128_0064_0001$$$::Oh, boy? Junior? Why are you hiding all of a sudden?[lr]::
16483::$$$message_0128_0064_0002$$$::I thought you had escaped."[lr]::
16484::$$$message_0128_0064_0003$$$::She looks at me, clinging to the back of the escalator, with a cold stare.::
16485::$$$message_0128_0065_0000$$$::"N-No, as much as I'd love to, I also have my own circumstances. It would make it complicated to explain things if they saw me with you."[lr]::
16486::$$$message_0128_0065_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
16487::$$$message_0128_0065_0002$$$::Caster bites her lip.::
16488::$$$message_0128_0066_0000$$$::"Men... are such..."[lr]::
16489::$$$message_0128_0066_0001$$$::O-Oh no.[lr]::
16490::$$$message_0128_0066_0002$$$::It seems like what I said rubbed her the wrong way.[lr]::
16491::$$$message_0128_0066_0003$$$::D-Dammit. I wonder whose fault it is.::
16492::$$$message_0128_0067_0000$$$::"Let's hurry.[lr]::
16493::$$$message_0128_0067_0001$$$::They shouldn't have gone too far."[lr]::
16494::$$$message_0128_0067_0002$$$::"Wait, let's wait a little[cacheimage storage=キャスター私服01i(中)][wvl][se storage=se215.wav][shock vmax=20 time=600 count=-8][chgfg textoff=0 pos=c time=200 storage=キャスター私服01i(中)][line len=3]Woah."[lr]::
16495::$$$message_0128_0067_0003$$$::She grabs me by the scruff of the neck and hurries me again.[lr]::
16496::$$$message_0128_0067_0004$$$::She exposes me for the public to see.::
16497::$$$message_0128_0068_0000$$$::From behind me, I feel like the sound of Makidera saying, "Woo, the front page of tomorrow's newspaper will be mine!" or Saegusa's "Huh, what, Maki?" or Himuro's "Hm" reached me, but I'm not worried about that at all anymore.[lr]::
16498::$$$message_0128_0068_0001$$$::...At all. Attt alllll... Why...::
16499::$$$message_0128_0069_0000$$$::"Where on earth did they go!?"[rf][lr]::
16500::$$$message_0128_0069_0001$$$::After running halfway around the mall, she snaps at the security guard in the parking lot.[lr]::
16501::$$$message_0128_0069_0002$$$::I guess she really doesn't care how she looks anymore.::
16502::$$$message_0128_0070_0000$$$::"Isn't that them?"[lr]::
16503::$$$message_0128_0070_0001$$$::The two of them go up the log stairs of a cottage-style store and disappear past the door.::
16504::$$$message_0128_0071_0000$$$::"...That's a café... Right?"[lr]::
16505::$$$message_0128_0071_0001$$$::"Seems like it. Ahh, I'm glad.[lr]::
16506::$$$message_0128_0071_0002$$$::Good thing it wasn't a love hotel or something."::
16507::$$$message_0128_0072_0000$$$::"Let's go now."[lr]::
16508::$$$message_0128_0072_0001$$$::"Yeah, of course."[lr]::
16509::$$$message_0128_0072_0002$$$::My bangs are important.[lr]::
16510::$$$message_0128_0072_0003$$$::As a matter of fact, my life is more important.[lr]::
16511::$$$message_0128_0072_0004$$$::That strange dagger can cut surprisingly well.::
16512::$$$message_0128_0073_0000$$$::We wait until the exact moment that another customer comes out of the store and sneak in through the door.[lr]::
16513::$$$message_0128_0073_0001$$$::The waitress tries to greet us by saying, "Welcome," but becomes rigid without being able to even say the first letter.[lr]::
16514::$$$message_0128_0073_0002$$$::As if she was glared at by Rider.[lr]::
16515::$$$message_0128_0073_0003$$$::Had I not put my pointer finger up to my lips and urged with my desperate eyes, we may have been reported to the local station as a pair of robbers.::
16516::$$$message_0128_0074_0000$$$::[line len=3]Fortunately, that didn't happen.[lr]::
16517::$$$message_0128_0074_0001$$$::"We are customers."[lr]::
16518::$$$message_0128_0074_0002$$$::"We don't have any intention of causing harm."[lr]::
16519::$$$message_0128_0074_0003$$$::"Please guide us to seats that don't stand out as much."[lr]::
16520::$$$message_0128_0074_0004$$$::"Please do not worry too much about this woman."[lr]::
16521::$$$message_0128_0074_0005$$$::I demonstrate those things with my gestures.[lr]::
16522::$$$message_0128_0074_0006$$$::Due to my effort, it seems like my passion and sincerity reaches the waitress, and she guides us to seats that are as far from other customers as possible.[lr]::
16523::$$$message_0128_0074_0007$$$::...Thanks to that, no one even takes our orders.::
16524::$$$message_0128_0075_0000$$$::As I look around the neat café, there's Fuji-nee and Mr. Kuzuki sitting facing each other by the window diagonally across the hall.[lr]::
16525::$$$message_0128_0075_0001$$$::The thick pillar that's in the center is in the way, so they haven't noticed us. I hope.::
16526::$$$message_0128_0076_0000$$$::The background music is like a café; calm and relaxing.[lr]::
16527::$$$message_0128_0076_0001$$$::It's a nice position where we can somewhat hear their conversation if we listen closely.::
16528::$$$message_0128_0077_0000$$$::"What would you like to order?"[lr]::
16529::$$$message_0128_0077_0001$$$::As we stay low at our table, the waiter finally decides to come.[lr]::
16530::$$$message_0128_0077_0002$$$::I frantically look through the menu.::
16531::$$$message_0128_0078_0000$$$::"Ale."[lr]::
16532::$$$message_0128_0078_0001$$$::Caster must also be restless trying to eavesdrop her conversation of her subjects, as she answers rudely while looking in the other direction.[lr]::
16533::$$$message_0128_0078_0002$$$::"Do you mean ginger ale?"[lr]::
16534::$$$message_0128_0078_0003$$$::"Don't even think about putting ginger in it. In that case, wine."::
16535::$$$message_0128_0079_0000$$$::"I am very sorry, ma'am. We only serve alcohol after 5 PM."[lr]::
16536::$$$message_0128_0079_0001$$$::"This store really doesn't have anything. Just water, then."[lr]::
16537::$$$message_0128_0079_0002$$$::"We specialize in tea, so..."[lr]::
16538::$$$message_0128_0079_0003$$$::...The waiter also tries rather hard.::
16539::$$$message_0128_0080_0000$$$::I also want to get out of this battle with the menu that has no explanation whatsoever.[lr]::
16540::$$$message_0128_0080_0001$$$::I at least know what Assam and Keemun are.[lr]::
16541::$$$message_0128_0080_0002$$$::What the heck are Nuwara Eliya or Lapsang souchong? Local greetings? New Servants?[lr]::
16542::$$$message_0128_0080_0003$$$::As someone with a bare-bones knowledge of cooking, my interest is endless.::
16543::$$$message_0128_0081_0000$$$::"For today, we have a special Irish-style blend prepared[line len=3]"[lr]::
16544::$$$message_0128_0081_0001$$$::"Tea is just colored water, right? They're all the same.[lr]::
16545::$$$message_0128_0081_0002$$$::Will you be quiet already? If you want an order, that boy over there will order two or three cups from you."[lr]::
16546::$$$message_0128_0081_0003$$$::Oof, how mean. That's too much.[lr]::
16547::$$$message_0128_0081_0004$$$::Apologize to tea. Also to me too, if you feel inclined to do so.::
16548::$$$message_0128_0082_0000$$$::"With all due respect, ma'am.[lr]::
16549::$$$message_0128_0082_0001$$$::Did you know that in Ireland, they say that tea is thicker than blood?[lr]::
16550::$$$message_0128_0082_0002$$$::Hey, you."[lr]::
16551::$$$message_0128_0082_0003$$$::Yeah. You tell her.[lr]::
16552::$$$message_0128_0082_0004$$$::That's my first time hearing that saying... [shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-3]wait, "hey, you"!?[lr]::
16553::$$$message_0128_0082_0005$$$::As I lift my face up from the menu in a panic[line len=3]::
16554::$$$message_0128_0083_0000$$$::"You ain't even ordering, yet is it this ear of yours that's talking all big like a paying customer? Huh?"[lr]::
16555::$$$message_0128_0083_0001$$$::"Ah!"[lr]::
16556::$$$message_0128_0083_0002$$$::"L-Lancer!"[lr]::
16557::$$$message_0128_0083_0003$$$::The one pinching the tip of Caster's ear is definitely Lancer.::
16558::$$$message_0128_0084_0000$$$::"Yo. You guys are some pretty smooth operators.[lr]::
16559::$$$message_0128_0084_0001$$$::Are you leaving behind your man and meeting in secret?"[lr]::
16560::$$$message_0128_0084_0002$$$::"No, that's not it."[lr]::
16561::$$$message_0128_0084_0003$$$::"What abusive language. U-Unbelievable."::
16562::$$$message_0128_0085_0000$$$::"...Lancer. Did you change jobs again?"[lr]::
16563::$$$message_0128_0085_0001$$$::My memory is very vague, but I thought Lancer had another part-time job.::
16564::$$$message_0128_0086_0000$$$::"Since the manager of the last store came to me begging in tears.[lr]::
16565::$$$message_0128_0086_0001$$$::There's a bunch of flowers and stuffed toys rolling around my lair in place of severance pay."[lr]::
16566::$$$message_0128_0086_0002$$$::"I see."[lr]::
16567::$$$message_0128_0086_0003$$$::[font italic=true]Isn't that just making him clean up?[font italic=false]::
16568::$$$message_0128_0087_0000$$$::"I don't care, but get that dirty finger away from me!"[lr]::
16569::$$$message_0128_0087_0001$$$::"Oh, sorry.[lr]::
16570::$$$message_0128_0087_0002$$$::I wanted to try touching those ears at least once."[lr]::
16571::$$$message_0128_0087_0003$$$::"Agreed, Lancer."[lr]::
16572::$$$message_0128_0087_0004$$$::"Right?"::
16573::$$$message_0128_0088_0000$$$::When I reach my arm out without thinking, Caster's ears twitch.[lr]::
16574::$$$message_0128_0088_0001$$$::"It moved!"::
16575::$$$message_0128_0089_0000$$$::"Of course. [l][say storage=cty0404_cas_0591 name=キャスター]Only Souichirou can touch my ears!"[lr]::
16576::$$$message_0128_0089_0001$$$::"Oh, he's touched them before?"[lr]::
16577::$$$message_0128_0089_0002$$$::"Shut up, you stray dog! Mongrel! Halfwit![lr]::
16578::$$$message_0128_0089_0003$$$::If you bite at me carelessly, I'll shred you up and turn you into shark bait!"::
16579::$$$message_0128_0090_0000$$$::"You'd get sent to a gas chamber nowadays."[lr]::
16580::$$$message_0128_0090_0001$$$::"That's fine, then."[lr]::
16581::$$$message_0128_0090_0002$$$::"Hahaha. That's the spirit, Mrs. Witch! That's more like you.[lr]::
16582::$$$message_0128_0090_0003$$$::[line len=3]So you didn't actually come to drink water, did you?"::
16583::$$$message_0128_0091_0000$$$::I come to my senses and make eye contact with Caster.[lr]::
16584::$$$message_0128_0091_0001$$$::I open the only menu to use it as a shield, and we both stick our faces into it.::
16585::$$$message_0128_0092_0000$$$::"Hm? There's some quite loud customers.[lr]::
16586::$$$message_0128_0092_0001$$$::Even though we chose a store that would be quiet."[lr]::
16587::$$$message_0128_0092_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
16588::$$$message_0128_0092_0003$$$::"By the way, Mr. Kuzuki. How does the Nail Gear taste?"[lr]::
16589::$$$message_0128_0092_0004$$$::"It's Nilgiri."::
16590::$$$message_0128_0093_0000$$$::"They didn't notice us... I think?"[lr]::
16591::$$$message_0128_0093_0001$$$::"...Seems like it..."[lr]::
16592::$$$message_0128_0093_0002$$$::Caster's face, which is breaking out in a cold sweat, is very close.[lr]::
16593::$$$message_0128_0093_0003$$$::I've been making her cry or getting her mad, but she's unbelievably gorgeous. Would he leave behind such a wife and actually cheat on her...?::
16594::$$$message_0128_0094_0000$$$::"...What are you guys doing?[lr]::
16595::$$$message_0128_0094_0001$$$::Huh? Is there some customer that you don't want to be seen by?"[lr]::
16596::$$$message_0128_0094_0002$$$::Lancer is looking over here while smiling.[lr]::
16597::$$$message_0128_0094_0003$$$::"Yeah. Actually[line len=2]"[lr]::
16598::$$$message_0128_0094_0004$$$::"...That's none of your business."::
16599::$$$message_0128_0095_0000$$$::"Fine, boy, go ahead and order something. Otherwise, we'll look suspicious."[lr]::
16600::$$$message_0128_0095_0001$$$::"You're going to actually treat me this time, right?"[lr]::
16601::$$$message_0128_0095_0002$$$::"We're splitting the bill, of course.[lr]::
16602::$$$message_0128_0095_0003$$$::I didn't come to go on a date with you, boy."[lr]::
16603::$$$message_0128_0095_0004$$$::What did we come here to do, then?[lr]::
16604::$$$message_0128_0095_0005$$$::Commit a crime?::
16605::$$$message_0128_0096_0000$$$::"What about this?[lr]::
16606::$$$message_0128_0096_0001$$$::A blend between Kenyan tea and Rwandan tea. I drank it too, and it's actually pretty good."[lr]::
16607::$$$message_0128_0096_0002$$$::"That's fine, then. Make that two."[lr]::
16608::$$$message_0128_0096_0003$$$::Caster shoos him away with her hand.[lr]::
16609::$$$message_0128_0096_0004$$$::How incredibly rude.::
16610::$$$message_0128_0097_0000$$$::"Understood. Just a moment, please."[lr]::
16611::$$$message_0128_0097_0001$$$::Lancer takes a bow respectfully and steps back.[lr]::
16612::$$$message_0128_0097_0002$$$::He looks pretty good as a waiter. He's friendly, so isn't he suited for customer service?[lr]::
16613::$$$message_0128_0097_0003$$$::And just as I had forgotten that he's a Servant, the numbers on the menu slap me in the face.::
16614::$$$message_0128_0098_0000$$$::One, seven, oh, oh.[lr]::
16615::$$$message_0128_0098_0001$$$::Huh? Wait. 1,700 yen?[lr]::
16616::$$$message_0128_0098_0002$$$::Do drinks that have a comma in the price actually exist?::
16617::$$$message_0128_0099_0000$$$::It probably comes in a teapot, but that would mean that even just one cup would cost more than 500 yen.[lr]::
16618::$$$message_0128_0099_0001$$$::Plus, the ones towards the bottom of the menu are all over 2,000 yen.[lr]::
16619::$$$message_0128_0099_0002$$$::Do they drink several cups of this tea every day?[lr]::
16620::$$$message_0128_0099_0003$$$::What a country Ireland is![lr]::
16621::$$$message_0128_0099_0004$$$::No wonder their staple food is junk food like fish and chips.::
16622::$$$message_0128_0100_0000$$$::Now, I focus my hearing on the two in question at the table.[lr]::
16623::$$$message_0128_0100_0001$$$::As usual, Mr. Kuzuki is silent, so I can hear Fuji-nee one-sidedly make small talk.[lr]::
16624::$$$message_0128_0100_0002$$$::But, she doesn't quite seem like her usual self.[lr]::
16625::$$$message_0128_0100_0003$$$::Her voice sounds shrill and nervous, like she doesn't want to get into the main subject.::
16626::$$$message_0128_0101_0000$$$::Caster throws them a glance while crouching down.[lr]::
16627::$$$message_0128_0101_0001$$$::"Up until now, they were avoiding places where their students or school staff would be, weren't they?"[lr]::
16628::$$$message_0128_0101_0002$$$::"...I think so. Most likely.[lr]::
16629::$$$message_0128_0101_0003$$$::It could be that they ended up at a laundromat thinking it was a restaurant because Fuji-nee made a mistake."::
16630::$$$message_0128_0102_0000$$$::"Could that be a misunderstanding?"[lr]::
16631::$$$message_0128_0102_0001$$$::"Probably. She could've been drawn in by the words, 'grand opening sale.'"[lr]::
16632::$$$message_0128_0102_0002$$$::"Over a reason like that?"[lr]::
16633::$$$message_0128_0102_0003$$$::"If there was some other deeper reason hidden behind that, then that would mean I haven't understood the homo sapiens named Fuji-nee in the slightest until now."::
16634::$$$message_0128_0103_0000$$$::"...So the reason that she came out of that model shop yelling wasn't because epoxy putty was sold out[line len=3]"[lr]::
16635::$$$message_0128_0103_0001$$$::"Huh? Did they stop by a place like that?"[lr]::
16636::$$$message_0128_0103_0002$$$::"They did."[lr]::
16637::$$$message_0128_0103_0003$$$::Epoxy putty?::
16638::$$$message_0128_0104_0000$$$::"Why is Souichirou with a woman like that...?"[lr]::
16639::$$$message_0128_0104_0001$$$::Caster bites her nails.[lr]::
16640::$$$message_0128_0104_0002$$$::"Like I said, it's nothing as crazy as what you're thinking..."[lr]::
16641::$$$message_0128_0104_0003$$$::"It wasn't sold out..."[lr]::
16642::$$$message_0128_0104_0004$$$::"..."::
16643::$$$message_0128_0105_0000$$$::Even though we're at an expensive store, I feel so uncomfortable.[lr]::
16644::$$$message_0128_0105_0001$$$::This is also because Fuji-nee didn't take any action to clear up the misunderstanding early on.[lr]::
16645::$$$message_0128_0105_0002$$$::Hurry up and talk about something to do with work.[lr]::
16646::$$$message_0128_0105_0003$$$::I'm begging you. Come on![lr]::
16647::$$$message_0128_0105_0004$$$::...And as I'm pleading, there is a chin next to my elbow on the table.::
16648::$$$message_0128_0106_0000$$$::"It's gonna get cold."[lr]::
16649::$$$message_0128_0106_0001$$$::"Oof[line len=3]L-Lancer..."[lr]::
16650::$$$message_0128_0106_0002$$$::"When did you... I didn't even notice your presence."[lr]::
16651::$$$message_0128_0106_0003$$$::Two tea sets are laid on the table without a sound, and steam rises from the cups.::
16652::$$$message_0128_0107_0000$$$::"Who do you guys think I am?[lr]::
16653::$$$message_0128_0107_0001$$$::I'm Ulster's Child of Light. Mr. Waiter of the King's spear.[lr]::
16654::$$$message_0128_0107_0002$$$::Drink it up before it gets bitter."[lr]::
16655::$$$message_0128_0107_0003$$$::"Did you say you brewed it?"[lr]::
16656::$$$message_0128_0107_0004$$$::"I said Mr. Waiter.[lr]::
16657::$$$message_0128_0107_0005$$$::The one who brewed it was the ghostly old man in the kitchen."::
16658::$$$message_0128_0108_0000$$$::Lancer narrows his eyes, still crouching by the table to not stand out.[lr]::
16659::$$$message_0128_0108_0001$$$::"So your targets are those customers, huh?[lr]::
16660::$$$message_0128_0108_0002$$$::Isn't that Kuzuki?"[lr]::
16661::$$$message_0128_0108_0003$$$::"..."::
16662::$$$message_0128_0109_0000$$$::The atmosphere changes.[lr]::
16663::$$$message_0128_0109_0001$$$::Even I can feel her intimidating the spearman with her presence as she keeps looking down at her teacup.::
16664::$$$message_0128_0110_0000$$$::"Hey, hey. Quit it."[lr]::
16665::$$$message_0128_0110_0001$$$::Lancer plays dumb and pours tea from the pot without asking.::
16666::$$$message_0128_0111_0000$$$::"I haven't fallen low enough to point a spear towards a customer.[lr]::
16667::$$$message_0128_0111_0001$$$::I don't want to get fired."[lr]::
16668::$$$message_0128_0111_0002$$$::"You're earnest."[lr]::
16669::$$$message_0128_0111_0003$$$::"Yeah. I'm a diligent soldier."[lr]::
16670::$$$message_0128_0111_0004$$$::"Wagging your tail towards your employer is the only skill you have."[lr]::
16671::$$$message_0128_0111_0005$$$::"Yeah, yeah. [cacheimage storage=ランサーギャルソン03f(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=500][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ランサーギャルソン03f(中)]Hold on, you shouldn't mix anything into it."::
16672::$$$message_0128_0112_0000$$$::Caster brings the cup to her mouth with a stiff expression.[lr]::
16673::$$$message_0128_0112_0001$$$::Then, her face becomes surprised with wonder. Her ears twitch again.[lr]::
16674::$$$message_0128_0112_0002$$$::"...It's good."[lr]::
16675::$$$message_0128_0112_0003$$$::"Oh yeah. This is... No wonder it's so expensive."[lr]::
16676::$$$message_0128_0112_0004$$$::"Right? See?"[lr]::
16677::$$$message_0128_0112_0005$$$::He smiles.::
16678::$$$message_0128_0113_0000$$$::The tea swirling inside the cup is a pretty dark copper color, but it's completely transparent, and the taste isn't bitter at all.[lr]::
16679::$$$message_0128_0113_0001$$$::I also feel like it's subtly sweet. I won't need milk for this. It tastes like the very essence of tea.[lr]::
16680::$$$message_0128_0113_0002$$$::Caster, whose maliciousness dissipates, lets out a sigh and releases the tension from her shoulders.[lr]::
16681::$$$message_0128_0113_0003$$$::The background music comes back.::
16682::$$$message_0128_0114_0000$$$::"By the way.[lr]::
16683::$$$message_0128_0114_0001$$$::It's my first time meeting your Master, but I know the woman next to him."[lr]::
16684::$$$message_0128_0114_0002$$$::"What?"[lr]::
16685::$$$message_0128_0114_0003$$$::"She's one of my fishing mates.[lr]::
16686::$$$message_0128_0114_0004$$$::That woman mostly just does the eating, though."::
16687::$$$message_0128_0115_0000$$$::Ahh, I see... I bury my face in my hands from embarrassment.[lr]::
16688::$$$message_0128_0115_0001$$$::"Sounds like her, that thieving tiger."[lr]::
16689::$$$message_0128_0115_0002$$$::Sorry. I'm an accomplice.::
16690::$$$message_0128_0116_0000$$$::"Hey. Can you tell me already, kid?[lr]::
16691::$$$message_0128_0116_0001$$$::What's going on?"::
16692::$$$message_0128_0117_0000$$$::I briefly explain from when I got captured by Caster and the full account of how we followed Fuji-nee and Mr. Kuzuki.[lr]::
16693::$$$message_0128_0117_0001$$$::"I see. Caster's concern is valid."[lr]::
16694::$$$message_0128_0117_0002$$$::"Thank you for agreeing. But, it sounds awfully convincing when you say that."::
16695::$$$message_0128_0118_0000$$$::"All right. I'll go poke around a bit then."[lr]::
16696::$$$message_0128_0118_0001$$$::"Hey... Lancer...!"[lr]::
16697::$$$message_0128_0118_0002$$$::"This one's on the house."[lr]::
16698::$$$message_0128_0118_0003$$$::He's playing detective.::
16699::$$$message_0128_0119_0000$$$::"Would you like some more tea?"[lr]::
16700::$$$message_0128_0119_0001$$$::"Gimme... [cacheimage storage=藤01c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤01c(中)]I mean, yes please. It was very good.[lr]::
16701::$$$message_0128_0119_0002$$$::But, are refills included?"[lr]::
16702::$$$message_0128_0119_0003$$$::"Only at this time on this day of the week, we include them for customers wearing stripes."::
16703::$$$message_0128_0120_0000$$$::"Oh, a freebie for stripes?"[lr]::
16704::$$$message_0128_0120_0001$$$::"Yes."[lr]::
16705::$$$message_0128_0120_0002$$$::"That's unfortunate. Please wear stripes next time, Mr. Kuzuki!"[lr]::
16706::$$$message_0128_0120_0003$$$::"...I see."::
16707::$$$message_0128_0121_0000$$$::"Souichirou, your underwear is striped!"[lr]::
16708::$$$message_0128_0121_0001$$$::"You don't have to tell him that."::
16709::$$$message_0128_0122_0000$$$::"Excuse me, but have we met before, Mrs...?"[lr]::
16710::$$$message_0128_0122_0001$$$::"What, M-M-Mrs.!?"::
16711::$$$message_0128_0123_0000$$$::"O-Of course not. Aha, no way."[lr]::
16712::$$$message_0128_0123_0001$$$::"Oh. Did I jump to conclusions?[lr]::
16713::$$$message_0128_0123_0002$$$::You two looked good together, like a pair of teacups, so I just assumed."[lr]::
16714::$$$message_0128_0123_0003$$$::"D-Did you hear that? My, what shall we do?"[lr]::
16715::$$$message_0128_0123_0004$$$::"Ahh."::
16716::$$$message_0128_0124_0000$$$::"Th[rf][wvl][se storage=se138.wav]A[large]a[wvl][se storage=se151.wav][small]a[rf][se storage=se421.wav][se storage=se420.wav]T[rf]t[large][wvl][se storage=se420.wav]T[rf]t wO[large][wvl][se storage=se411.wav]mA[rf][wvl][se storage=se050.wav][se storage=se723.wav]n[large][wvl][se storage=se420.wav][se storage=se421.wav]N!"[rf][wvl][se storage=se151.wav][lr]::
16717::$$$message_0128_0124_0001$$$::"You're stabbing the table![lr]::
16718::$$$message_0128_0124_0002$$$::Put your strange dagger away!"[lr]::
16719::$$$message_0128_0124_0003$$$::It's a state of emergency, Fuji-nee![lr]::
16720::$$$message_0128_0124_0004$$$::Please respond with a firm attitude as soon as possible![lr]::
16721::$$$message_0128_0124_0005$$$::The table is turning into oversized trash!::
16722::$$$message_0128_0125_0000$$$::"Oh, could you possibly be Mr. Aloha Shirt?"[lr]::
16723::$$$message_0128_0125_0001$$$::"It seems like you've finally realized."[lr]::
16724::$$$message_0128_0125_0002$$$::"Wow, I couldn't tell at all. I didn't recognize you."[lr]::
16725::$$$message_0128_0125_0003$$$::"Do you know each other?"[lr]::
16726::$$$message_0128_0125_0004$$$::"Yes. Let me introduce you."::
16727::$$$message_0128_0126_0000$$$::"He's at the port often and shares the fish he catches with me.[lr]::
16728::$$$message_0128_0126_0001$$$::He's a very famous fisher, despite the aloha shirt."[lr]::
16729::$$$message_0128_0126_0002$$$::"Oh."[lr]::
16730::$$$message_0128_0126_0003$$$::"Hahahaha, you speak too highly of me."::
16731::$$$message_0128_0127_0000$$$::"You don't have any fish today, do you? [cacheimage storage=藤08a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤08a(中)]Oh, because you're not wearing your aloha shirt?"[lr]::
16732::$$$message_0128_0127_0001$$$::"Since I'm working. [cacheimage storage=ランサーギャルソン01g(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ランサーギャルソン01g(中)]By the way, the aloha shirt isn't a fishing tool."::
16733::$$$message_0128_0128_0000$$$::And like so, Fuji-nee and Lancer start passionately discussing the different kinds of black porgy they can fish at the port or how to fillet the fish or drain blood from it. The surrounding customers start to get more pale.::
16734::$$$message_0128_0129_0000$$$::Eventually, the young waitress from earlier pokes Lancer's back and brings him to the back of the store.[lr]::
16735::$$$message_0128_0129_0001$$$::And a few minutes of waiting.[lr]::
16736::$$$message_0128_0129_0002$$$::Lancer comes back to our table with a cheerful look.::
16737::$$$message_0128_0130_0000$$$::"All right, I think I've grasped the general idea."[lr]::
16738::$$$message_0128_0130_0001$$$::"...Really?"[lr]::
16739::$$$message_0128_0130_0002$$$::"It seemed like you were getting yelled at in the back."[lr]::
16740::$$$message_0128_0130_0003$$$::"A little bit."::
16741::$$$message_0128_0131_0000$$$::"Well, just like this..."[lr]::
16742::$$$message_0128_0131_0001$$$::He crouches his body again and brings his face close to Caster's.[lr]::
16743::$$$message_0128_0131_0002$$$::"Once I stared at her silently, she let me go right away."::
16744::$$$message_0128_0132_0000$$$::"That obviously wouldn't be enough."[lr]::
16745::$$$message_0128_0132_0001$$$::She taps the tip of Lancer's nose with the menu.[lr]::
16746::$$$message_0128_0132_0002$$$::"Heh, you saw through me, huh?"[lr]::
16747::$$$message_0128_0132_0003$$$::"Yes. I can, especially with people like you."[lr]::
16748::$$$message_0128_0132_0004$$$::"Oh. Actually, I also have a good nose for sniffing out the intentions of certain types of people."::
16749::$$$message_0128_0133_0000$$$::"But to be honest, I can't tell at all about that weird woman!"[lr]::
16750::$$$message_0128_0133_0001$$$::He strongly declares.::
16751::$$$message_0128_0134_0000$$$::"But, I could read Kuzuki on the whole."[lr]::
16752::$$$message_0128_0134_0001$$$::"You weren't talking to him at all."[lr]::
16753::$$$message_0128_0134_0002$$$::"Even so."[lr]::
16754::$$$message_0128_0134_0003$$$::"...What were you able to gather?"::
16755::$$$message_0128_0135_0000$$$::"Hm, let's see.[lr]::
16756::$$$message_0128_0135_0001$$$::He's the type to enjoy being used by women."::
16757::$$$message_0128_0136_0000$$$::"Like taking care of them or pretending to be generous by listening to their selfish requests.[lr]::
16758::$$$message_0128_0136_0001$$$::Being unhappy is comfortable for him. A masochist of sorts."[lr]::
16759::$$$message_0128_0136_0002$$$::"[line len=3]Wha..."::
16760::$$$message_0128_0137_0000$$$::"Even if he's a man and you're a woman, your relationship is originally Master and Servant. That's weird. [cacheimage storage=ランサーギャルソン01f(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=ランサーギャルソン01f(中)]Right?"[lr]::
16761::$$$message_0128_0137_0001$$$::"Why are you looking at me?"[lr]::
16762::$$$message_0128_0137_0002$$$::"Hahaha..."::
16763::$$$message_0128_0138_0000$$$::Caster bites her lip and looks away.[lr]::
16764::$$$message_0128_0138_0001$$$::"Say what you want..."[lr]::
16765::$$$message_0128_0138_0002$$$::"Oh? Are you mad?"[lr]::
16766::$$$message_0128_0138_0003$$$::"I am just ashamed that I seriously listened to your nonsense."::
16767::$$$message_0128_0139_0000$$$::"How harsh.[lr]::
16768::$$$message_0128_0139_0001$$$::I heard a rumor that you two are pretending to be a married couple at Ryudou Temple."[lr]::
16769::$$$message_0128_0139_0002$$$::"Pre...tend..."::
16770::$$$message_0128_0140_0000$$$::She turns to him, obviously angry for an instant.[lr]::
16771::$$$message_0128_0140_0001$$$::But she stammers and looks away again.[lr]::
16772::$$$message_0128_0140_0002$$$::I think she was trying to object that they're not pretending.[lr]::
16773::$$$message_0128_0140_0003$$$::But she couldn't.[lr]::
16774::$$$message_0128_0140_0004$$$::As if seeing through that, Lancer pursues it.::
16775::$$$message_0128_0141_0000$$$::"Give it up.[lr]::
16776::$$$message_0128_0141_0001$$$::No matter how far you go, it's not like you can visibly see certain bonds. It's best to just go with the flow."[lr]::
16777::$$$message_0128_0141_0002$$$::"..."::
16778::$$$message_0128_0142_0000$$$::"Lancer. Are you trying to disturb the peace of the Kuzuki household?"[lr]::
16779::$$$message_0128_0142_0001$$$::"What? Hey now. Don't make that face too, kid."[lr]::
16780::$$$message_0128_0142_0002$$$::Lancer scratches his head and messes up his styled hair.::
16781::$$$message_0128_0143_0000$$$::"My bad. Was the way I said it too rough?[lr]::
16782::$$$message_0128_0143_0001$$$::I'm just trying to say that you should be more carefree. There's no need to act big about being a married couple. You'll just get tired."::
16783::$$$message_0128_0144_0000$$$::"You shouldn't waste your chance for fun like that. [lr]::
16784::$$$message_0128_0144_0001$$$::If you make the same mistake, are you going to be able to bounce back?"[lr]::
16785::$$$message_0128_0144_0002$$$::"Lancer!"[lr]::
16786::$$$message_0128_0144_0003$$$::"Well, just listen. Even I was a married man. A father of a child.[lr]::
16787::$$$message_0128_0144_0004$$$::People have different ways of thinking. There are times when you can learn from them if you listen."::
16788::$$$message_0128_0145_0000$$$::"Let's say, hypothetically, that he cheated on you.[lr]::
16789::$$$message_0128_0145_0001$$$::Everyone makes mistakes. Sometimes you get horny, and sometimes you get so angry that you just want to let off some steam."::
16790::$$$message_0128_0146_0000$$$::"If that happens[line len=3]you probably wouldn't forgive him with the way you are now.[lr]::
16791::$$$message_0128_0146_0001$$$::Who knows what you would do?[lr]::
16792::$$$message_0128_0146_0002$$$::Are you sure you're okay with letting everything go over just one mistake? That kind of relationship is way too fragile."::
16793::$$$message_0128_0147_0000$$$::"...Are you trying to say that a strong couple is able to compromise on anything?"[lr]::
16794::$$$message_0128_0147_0001$$$::"Exactly. A rowan branch is flexible and tenacious. It doesn't break even in a storm or snow.[lr]::
16795::$$$message_0128_0147_0002$$$::Say you make a small dam around your own lake. Even if some water escapes, the lake won't dry up, and the sky won't come falling down either."::
16796::$$$message_0128_0148_0000$$$::...Lancer must be trying to cheer her up in his own way.[lr]::
16797::$$$message_0128_0148_0001$$$::But the drawback of all three of us ducking low and clinging onto the table is that it doesn't exactly create a serious atmosphere.::
16798::$$$message_0128_0149_0000$$$::"'My partner must have some sort of outlet. That's why it's fine even if I cheat'[line len=3]that seems to be your excuse."::
16799::$$$message_0128_0150_0000$$$::"But you must also have some sacred oath that you can't give up. Although you seem to be thinking that only exists among men."[lr]::
16800::$$$message_0128_0150_0001$$$::"A sacred oath, huh... [cacheimage storage=ランサーギャルソン01d(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=ランサーギャルソン01d(中)]Of course I had a few that I couldn't break. But the thing with those is that you can't think too hard about them.[lr]::
16801::$$$message_0128_0150_0002$$$::You just try to keep them. Whether they were right or wrong is something you can reflect back on when on your deathbed."::
16802::$$$message_0128_0151_0000$$$::"..."[lr]::
16803::$$$message_0128_0151_0001$$$::Things that bind you that you can't give up to others.[lr]::
16804::$$$message_0128_0151_0002$$$::Lancer says that those aren't things you're supposed to analyze but to accept and abide by silently.[lr]::
16805::$$$message_0128_0151_0003$$$::...This is the biggest difference between this spearman and that bowman.[lr]::
16806::$$$message_0128_0151_0004$$$::They are both obliging men, but the other warns you every time you make a mistake and tries to help you improve.[lr]::
16807::$$$message_0128_0151_0005$$$::This one approves of even your mistakes and helps without saying a word.::
16808::$$$message_0128_0152_0000$$$::"...Heh. No matter how many times I've lived before, this is my only life.[lr]::
16809::$$$message_0128_0152_0001$$$::You must never be able to feel like you're truly living without having an established Master and living aloof from the world."[lr]::
16810::$$$message_0128_0152_0002$$$::"Maybe. Life is a cycle.[lr]::
16811::$$$message_0128_0152_0003$$$::That aside[line len=3]it seems like they're getting into the main subject."::
16812::$$$message_0128_0153_0000$$$::Just as he says, when I look over, Fuji-nee is awkwardly propping her elbows up on the table and clasping her hands together.[lr]::
16813::$$$message_0128_0153_0001$$$::As expected of a sentry and scout genius. He always keeps his eyes alert, no matter the situation.::
16814::$$$message_0128_0154_0000$$$::"So, um, about why I brought you here.[lr]::
16815::$$$message_0128_0154_0001$$$::Isn't it a fine day today?[lr]::
16816::$$$message_0128_0154_0002$$$::There is something I'd like to consult you about."[lr]::
16817::$$$message_0128_0154_0003$$$::"..."[lr]::
16818::$$$message_0128_0154_0004$$$::"Um, what do you think of me as a woman?"::
16819::$$$message_0128_0155_0000$$$::"...!"[lr]::
16820::$$$message_0128_0155_0001$$$::"...!"[lr]::
16821::$$$message_0128_0155_0002$$$::[font italic=true]F-FUJI-NEEE...![font italic=false]::
16822::$$$message_0128_0156_0000$$$::"...!!!"[lr]::
16823::$$$message_0128_0156_0001$$$::Caster grabs Lancer's ear, making a dull sound.[lr]::
16824::$$$message_0128_0156_0002$$$::"...! ...!!!"[rf][lr]::
16825::$$$message_0128_0156_0003$$$::Lancer is screaming silently. His earrings are about to rip off. I'm glad I'm not sitting next to her.::
16826::$$$message_0128_0157_0000$$$::"Oops, I went ahead and said it.[lr]::
16827::$$$message_0128_0157_0001$$$::M-My apologies.[lr]::
16828::$$$message_0128_0157_0002$$$::There could've been a better way for me to ask."[lr]::
16829::$$$message_0128_0157_0003$$$::"..."::
16830::$$$message_0128_0158_0000$$$::"I'm really sorry.[lr]::
16831::$$$message_0128_0158_0001$$$::This is very sudden. But, I wanted to hear your honest feelings."[lr]::
16832::$$$message_0128_0158_0002$$$::"...My feelings?"[lr]::
16833::$$$message_0128_0158_0003$$$::"Yes, it has to be you."::
16834::$$$message_0128_0159_0000$$$::"...! ...! ...!"[lr]::
16835::$$$message_0128_0159_0001$$$::"L-Let go! I said let go of him![lr]::
16836::$$$message_0128_0159_0002$$$::Hey, Casko!"[lr]::
16837::$$$message_0128_0159_0003$$$::Oh no, it's going to rip off.[lr]::
16838::$$$message_0128_0159_0004$$$::Caster's eyes are wide open, yet she doesn't notice my hushed efforts to restrain her or Lancer suffering in agony.[lr]::
16839::$$$message_0128_0159_0005$$$::Her arms are just trembling.::
16840::$$$message_0128_0160_0000$$$::"...[lr]::
16841::$$$message_0128_0160_0001$$$::I can't quite follow. Can you please walk me through this from the beginning?"[lr]::
16842::$$$message_0128_0160_0002$$$::"O-Oh, yes. Of course.[lr]::
16843::$$$message_0128_0160_0003$$$::Geez, I keep doing this..."::
16844::$$$message_0128_0161_0000$$$::Fuji-nee lightly smacks her cheeks and takes a sip of her tea.[lr]::
16845::$$$message_0128_0161_0001$$$::Yeah. I'm begging you, so please calm down, Fuji-nee.[lr]::
16846::$$$message_0128_0161_0002$$$::Lancer's ears are on the line.::
16847::$$$message_0128_0162_0000$$$::"So, a student actually asked me for advice the other day.[lr]::
16848::$$$message_0128_0162_0001$$$::From a girl about what you would call love troubles."::
16849::$$$message_0128_0163_0000$$$::"I've been asked for advice on things like that before, too.[lr]::
16850::$$$message_0128_0163_0001$$$::So that wasn't the first time in particular. [cacheimage storage=葛木02a眼鏡(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=葛木02a眼鏡(中)]Although it's not like I get them all the time.[lr]::
16851::$$$message_0128_0163_0002$$$::Well of course, I felt honored as a teacher to be consulted about something like that.[lr]::
16852::$$$message_0128_0163_0003$$$::I tried my best to listen like a relative and think things through with her."::
16853::$$$message_0128_0164_0000$$$::The direction of the conversation that I hear slightly diverts from the worst-case scenario that I was expecting from the beginning and I become a bit relieved.[lr]::
16854::$$$message_0128_0164_0001$$$::Lancer also gets released from getting his ear ripped off and crouches on the floor, holding the side of his head.[lr]::
16855::$$$message_0128_0164_0002$$$::What a pitiful spearman. Be grateful that you still have your ears.::
16856::$$$message_0128_0165_0000$$$::"That's how it was, but...[lr]::
16857::$$$message_0128_0165_0001$$$::I might've gotten a bit conceited from being thanked about that before."[lr]::
16858::$$$message_0128_0165_0002$$$::"So it was not successful?"[lr]::
16859::$$$message_0128_0165_0003$$$::"No."::
16860::$$$message_0128_0166_0000$$$::"It's not like she dislikes me, but even if I talk to her, she no longer confides in me anymore.[lr]::
16861::$$$message_0128_0166_0001$$$::It's like I lost her trust."[lr]::
16862::$$$message_0128_0166_0002$$$::"I will not say a word about this to anyone."[lr]::
16863::$$$message_0128_0166_0003$$$::"I appreciate it."[lr]::
16864::$$$message_0128_0166_0004$$$::Fuji-nee is tearing up a bit.[lr]::
16865::$$$message_0128_0166_0005$$$::...Something like that happened? I never noticed.::
16866::$$$message_0128_0167_0000$$$::"And what she said to me has been bothering me. I was wondering if there was anyone I could confide in this time...[lr]::
16867::$$$message_0128_0167_0001$$$::Well, it's pathetic of me, though."[lr]::
16868::$$$message_0128_0167_0002$$$::"What did she say?"::
16869::$$$message_0128_0168_0000$$$::"She told me this.[lr]::
16870::$$$message_0128_0168_0001$$$::'You don't have a boyfriend, and you're not divorced. There's no point in talking to you,' she said."[lr]::
16871::$$$message_0128_0168_0002$$$::"...As in, it's meaningless to confide in you because you do not have enough life experience?"[lr]::
16872::$$$message_0128_0168_0003$$$::"Yes."::
16873::$$$message_0128_0169_0000$$$::"I see, I see.[lr]::
16874::$$$message_0128_0169_0001$$$::So Kuzuki was singled out to play with fire.[lr]::
16875::$$$message_0128_0169_0002$$$::Enjoying the life of a cheater to the fullest, huh? [cacheimage storage=キャスター私服01f(近),ランサーギャルソン01a(近)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=キャスター私服01f(近),ランサーギャルソン01a(近)]Way to go, woman."[lr]::
16876::$$$message_0128_0169_0003$$$::A blade is pointed right below Lancer's nose, as he makes a smug face.::
16877::$$$message_0128_0170_0000$$$::"Your two nostrils will become one."[lr]::
16878::$$$message_0128_0170_0001$$$::"Hee, heeheheheihah."::
16879::$$$message_0128_0171_0000$$$::"I was well aware that I am inexperienced, but...[lr]::
16880::$$$message_0128_0171_0001$$$::Also, another thing. This one hit home."::
16881::$$$message_0128_0172_0000$$$::"'You wouldn't know since you like anyone and are liked by anyone.' 'No one has told you that they don't think anything of you, right? You must not be able to imagine anyone avoiding you.' ...She said."::
16882::$$$message_0128_0173_0000$$$::"I am confident that I can like people regardless of gender. [cacheimage storage=藤01f(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤01f(中)]But what she wanted to say was obviously not that..."::
16883::$$$message_0128_0174_0000$$$::"It's either he likes her, or he hates her. Or she's out of the question.[lr]::
16884::$$$message_0128_0174_0001$$$::There's no in-between. She must've wanted a clear decision."::
16885::$$$message_0128_0175_0000$$$::"Well, to be honest, yes.[lr]::
16886::$$$message_0128_0175_0001$$$::There's no such talk like that around me.[lr]::
16887::$$$message_0128_0175_0002$$$::I may be the furthest person from those kinds of things in all of Fuyuki City, no, maybe all of Western Japan."[lr]::
16888::$$$message_0128_0175_0003$$$::[font italic=true]N-No, that's... not...[font italic=false]::
16889::$$$message_0128_0176_0000$$$::"I cannot guarantee that I will be of help."[lr]::
16890::$$$message_0128_0176_0001$$$::"That's it.[lr]::
16891::$$$message_0128_0176_0002$$$::There are other teachers who have a lot of experience in romance, but with all due respect, it's in the past for them. When thinking of whether or not they can relate when I ask them for advice, [cacheimage storage=藤08e(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤08e(中)]I'm a bit... um, worried."::
16892::$$$message_0128_0177_0000$$$::She must've not wanted them to think that it's a worry that time can solve.[lr]::
16893::$$$message_0128_0177_0001$$$::Maybe the student that asked Fuji-nee for help might've felt the same way.[lr]::
16894::$$$message_0128_0177_0002$$$::I think they can have more confidence in themselves...::
16895::$$$message_0128_0178_0000$$$::"You have just gotten married.[lr]::
16896::$$$message_0128_0178_0001$$$::In other words, I should mean nothing to you."[lr]::
16897::$$$message_0128_0178_0002$$$::Caster nods strongly.[lr]::
16898::$$$message_0128_0178_0003$$$::Lancer also nods along with her.[lr]::
16899::$$$message_0128_0178_0004$$$::Thanks to that, he still has two nostrils.::
16900::$$$message_0128_0179_0000$$$::"That is why today...[lr]::
16901::$$$message_0128_0179_0001$$$::I was hoping you can talk about how you have no interest in me as a woman and not a teacher."[lr]::
16902::$$$message_0128_0179_0002$$$::"..."::
16903::$$$message_0128_0180_0000$$$::"I am well aware that I am asking for too much.[lr]::
16904::$$$message_0128_0180_0001$$$::But, you were the only one that I thought would take this seriously.[lr]::
16905::$$$message_0128_0180_0002$$$::Oh, see, I was thinking there's all kinds of reasons as to why someone might not think anything about a person!"::
16906::$$$message_0128_0181_0000$$$::"Like she's rough, her fashion sense is not woman-like and unsophisticated, she eats too much, she sleeps right after eating, she's a tiger, or so on."::
16907::$$$message_0128_0182_0000$$$::"Ahh, I'm sorry.[lr]::
16908::$$$message_0128_0182_0001$$$::I'm just rambling endlessly on my own, aren't I? Shall we drink some tea?"[lr]::
16909::$$$message_0128_0182_0002$$$::"Yes."[lr]::
16910::$$$message_0128_0182_0003$$$::That's just because Mr. Kuzuki doesn't talk at all[line len=3]but anyway...[lr]::
16911::$$$message_0128_0182_0004$$$::This is difficult.::
16912::$$$message_0128_0183_0000$$$::Fuji-nee signals to the waitress and orders another tea with a weird name.[lr]::
16913::$$$message_0128_0183_0001$$$::When I shift my focus back to in front of me, Caster, whose doubts were all cleared up, has an expression as refreshed as a fine autumn day.[lr]::
16914::$$$message_0128_0183_0002$$$::Lancer seems to be thinking through Fuji-nee's confusing question, as he has a solemn expression on his face.::
16915::$$$message_0128_0184_0000$$$::"Oh, Souichirou.[lr]::
16916::$$$message_0128_0184_0001$$$::He could've at least said something if a colleague was asking for his advice. I could keep a secret. But, how kind of him to look out for his coworker." [lr]::
16917::$$$message_0128_0184_0002$$$::"Hmm, I don't know about that."[lr]::
16918::$$$message_0128_0184_0003$$$::"...What?[lr]::
16919::$$$message_0128_0184_0004$$$::If you're trying to sell laundry poles, then no thank you."::
16920::$$$message_0128_0185_0000$$$::"Bamboo, bamboo poles for sale~[humming][lr]::
16921::$$$message_0128_0185_0001$$$::Tsk, don't hang your smelly loincloth on my spear!"::
16922::$$$message_0128_0186_0000$$$::"We don't know just yet if she's only asking for advice."[lr]::
16923::$$$message_0128_0186_0001$$$::"Are you saying there could be more trouble?"[lr]::
16924::$$$message_0128_0186_0002$$$::"We don't know. I have no clue.[lr]::
16925::$$$message_0128_0186_0003$$$::They're talking heart-to-heart. We never know how things will turn out..."::
16926::$$$message_0128_0187_0000$$$::"...Heh.[lr]::
16927::$$$message_0128_0187_0001$$$::You're just stirring my uneasiness, aren't you? Aren't you just trying to say that you told me so in hindsight?"[lr]::
16928::$$$message_0128_0187_0002$$$::"Hahaha. Heheheh."::
16929::$$$message_0128_0188_0000$$$::"Haha..."[lr]::
16930::$$$message_0128_0188_0001$$$::Anyway.[lr]::
16931::$$$message_0128_0188_0002$$$::There aren't many men who can clearly answer a question like Fuji-nee's.::
16932::$$$message_0128_0189_0000$$$::Anyone would hold back, unless they had bad intentions to start with.[lr]::
16933::$$$message_0128_0189_0001$$$::First of all, you wouldn't normally think about why you're not considering the person next to you as a romantic interest in the first place.[lr]::
16934::$$$message_0128_0189_0002$$$::That's not something you're conscious about in the first place.[lr]::
16935::$$$message_0128_0189_0003$$$::Whoever asked Fuji-nee for advice is also asking too much of her. Geez.::
16936::$$$message_0128_0190_0000$$$::If someone were to be able to answer...[lr]::
16937::$$$message_0128_0190_0001$$$::They need to have enough life experience,[lr]::
16938::$$$message_0128_0190_0002$$$::be composed enough to be able to reflect on themselves at anytime,[lr]::
16939::$$$message_0128_0190_0003$$$::be able to point out the other person's faults earnestly, yet relentlessly... That kind of person?[lr]::
16940::$$$message_0128_0190_0004$$$::And a man I know that would correspond to that is...::
16941::$$$message_0128_0191_0000$$$::Lancer...?[lr]::
16942::$$$message_0128_0191_0001$$$::Definitely not him.::
16943::$$$message_0128_0192_0000$$$::Mr. Kuzuki after all... I think.[lr]::
16944::$$$message_0128_0192_0001$$$::Well, but...[lr]::
16945::$$$message_0128_0192_0002$$$::It's normal to worry that the person you're talking to might dislike you or think interacting with you is a hassle.[lr]::
16946::$$$message_0128_0192_0003$$$::Unless you're extremely self-centered[line len=3]or have an innocent personality like a certain somebody.[lr]::
16947::$$$message_0128_0192_0004$$$::I wonder if it would be shock therapy for that certain somebody.::
16948::$$$message_0128_0193_0000$$$::After taking a sip from the new tea that was brought, Mr. Kuzuki solemnly speaks up.::
16949::$$$message_0128_0194_0000$$$::"I still cannot shake off the doubt of whether I am the right person to consult, but I shall answer if that is your wish."[lr]::
16950::$$$message_0128_0194_0001$$$::"Y-Yes please."::
16951::$$$message_0128_0195_0000$$$::"As you said, I have no interest in you whatsoever."[lr]::
16952::$$$message_0128_0195_0001$$$::"O-Of course."[lr]::
16953::$$$message_0128_0195_0002$$$::Caster subtly fist pumps.::
16954::$$$message_0128_0196_0000$$$::"If I were asked as a man whether I have any desires towards you as a woman, I also do not have any. Not to mention, it is impossible for me to have any romantic feelings towards you."[lr]::
16955::$$$message_0128_0196_0001$$$::"O-[wvl canskip=0 time=400]O-[wvl canskip=0 time=400]Of courseee."::
16956::$$$message_0128_0197_0000$$$::Even Fuji-nee is shaken up.[lr]::
16957::$$$message_0128_0197_0001$$$::Next to the gloating Caster, Lancer is hanging his head low with a dreary expression.::
16958::$$$message_0128_0198_0000$$$::"As long as we can get along smoothly as coworkers, that is fine with me."[lr]::
16959::$$$message_0128_0198_0001$$$::"Y-Yes..."[lr]::
16960::$$$message_0128_0198_0002$$$::Fuji-nee gets small.[lr]::
16961::$$$message_0128_0198_0003$$$::[font italic=true]P-Please stop already.[font italic=false][lr]::
16962::$$$message_0128_0198_0004$$$::[font italic=true]Oww. It hurts more than I can imagine even listening from the outside.[font italic=false]::
16963::$$$message_0128_0199_0000$$$::"That is what I had thought."[lr]::
16964::$$$message_0128_0199_0001$$$::"...[font italic=true]'Thought'[font italic=false]?[lr]::
16965::$$$message_0128_0199_0002$$$::Had [font italic=true]thought[font italic=false]?"::
16966::$$$message_0128_0200_0000$$$::Lancer straightens up.[lr]::
16967::$$$message_0128_0200_0001$$$::His eyes light up.[lr]::
16968::$$$message_0128_0200_0002$$$::So he does like that kind of stuff after all.::
16969::$$$message_0128_0201_0000$$$::"I am not interested in people overall.[lr]::
16970::$$$message_0128_0201_0001$$$::I am not interested in the hardships and joys of life. Nor what others think of me. Nor whether one loves me or hates me.[lr]::
16971::$$$message_0128_0201_0002$$$::The only thing that I am concerned about is whether someone is dead or not."[lr]::
16972::$$$message_0128_0201_0003$$$::"W-[cacheimage storage=藤02c腕b(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=-4][chgfg textoff=0 pos=l time=300 storage=藤02c腕b(中)]Whaat...!?"::
16973::$$$message_0128_0202_0000$$$::Fuji-nee's surprised exclamation could be heard throughout the shop. She leans forward.[lr]::
16974::$$$message_0128_0202_0001$$$::"B-But, you have a wife, right?"[lr]::
16975::$$$message_0128_0202_0002$$$::"I certainly do, but it is not a love marriage."[lr]::
16976::$$$message_0128_0202_0003$$$::"Huh... T-Then, was it an arranged marriage?[lr]::
16977::$$$message_0128_0202_0004$$$::Or a fiancée that was forced onto you by your family?"[lr]::
16978::$$$message_0128_0202_0005$$$::"If I were to say, it is like an arranged marriage.[lr]::
16979::$$$message_0128_0202_0006$$$::However, it was not something that happened from my own actions, but you can say that it was accidental."::
16980::$$$message_0128_0203_0000$$$::I timidly look over to Caster.[lr]::
16981::$$$message_0128_0203_0001$$$::Caster is looking down, and I can't see her expression from her bangs. Fortunately.[lr]::
16982::$$$message_0128_0203_0002$$$::Even Lancer is slightly flinching away.::
16983::$$$message_0128_0204_0000$$$::"[chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=藤02c腕b(中)]Wha...[cacheimage storage=藤02c腕c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=藤02c腕c(中)]whawhawha...[cacheimage storage=藤02c腕b(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=藤02c腕b(中)]whawhawha...[cacheimage storage=藤02c腕c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=藤02c腕c(中)]wha...[cacheimage storage=藤02c腕a(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=200 storage=藤02c腕a(中)]wha..."[lr]::
16984::$$$message_0128_0204_0001$$$::Fuji-nee, who sounds like she's reciting a poem by Kenji Miyazawa, takes a deep breath and somehow calms herself down.[lr]::
16985::$$$message_0128_0204_0002$$$::She asks with a still shrill voice.::
16986::$$$message_0128_0205_0000$$$::"W-What do you mean?"[lr]::
16987::$$$message_0128_0205_0001$$$::"I mean that you can still live even if you are not interested in others."::
16988::$$$message_0128_0206_0000$$$::"I teach that humans are creatures that cannot live on their own in my own classes, but that is considering the system of mutual security in the modern state.[lr]::
16989::$$$message_0128_0206_0001$$$::If you actually think on the individual level, you do not need others.[lr]::
16990::$$$message_0128_0206_0002$$$::Tools or things. There is no need to think that others are humans like yourself."::
16991::$$$message_0128_0207_0000$$$::"For example, animals that hunt alone think about their own territory, getting a partner to mate and have offspring, then drive them out of their territory. Depending on the situation, they may kill them."::
16992::$$$message_0128_0208_0000$$$::"Oh. Like how the female spider eats the male after mating with them..."[lr]::
16993::$$$message_0128_0208_0001$$$::"That is the typical example of using the opposite sex for survival."::
16994::$$$message_0128_0209_0000$$$::"But can you call a relationship where you both try to use one another efficiently love?[lr]::
16995::$$$message_0128_0209_0001$$$::Can one not make a living without liking the person they work with?"[lr]::
16996::$$$message_0128_0209_0002$$$::"I-I suppose.[lr]::
16997::$$$message_0128_0209_0003$$$::There is... no need to necessarily consider your partner as an individual. You would still be able to live."::
16998::$$$message_0128_0210_0000$$$::"Yes. If you want to simply live, you can do that alone."[lr]::
16999::$$$message_0128_0210_0001$$$::"Yes..."::
17000::$$$message_0128_0211_0000$$$::I return my gaze and am stunned.[lr]::
17001::$$$message_0128_0211_0001$$$::Smirking Lancer is slowly extending his finger towards Caster's bangs. She is looking down.[lr]::
17002::$$$message_0128_0211_0002$$$::U-Unbelievable.[lr]::
17003::$$$message_0128_0211_0003$$$::There must be a limit to morbid curiosity.[lr]::
17004::$$$message_0128_0211_0004$$$::Is he trying to open the gates of hell!?::
17005::$$$message_0128_0212_0000$$$::I lean forward to try to stop his reckless actions, but he grabs my face with his other hand.[lr]::
17006::$$$message_0128_0212_0001$$$::[se storage=se291.wav]The next moment.[lr]::
17007::$$$message_0128_0212_0002$$$::His fingertip lifts her bangs up.[lr]::
17008::$$$message_0128_0212_0003$$$::What appears is...[lr]::
17009::$$$message_0128_0212_0004$$$::There is no sign of rage.::
17010::$$$message_0128_0213_0000$$$::What is there are...unwavering blue eyes.[lr]::
17011::$$$message_0128_0213_0001$$$::A calm smile full of trust.::
17012::$$$message_0128_0214_0000$$$::"T...That is not good!"[lr]::
17013::$$$message_0128_0214_0001$$$::Fuji-nee suddenly stands up from her seat.[lr]::
17014::$$$message_0128_0214_0002$$$::"..."[lr]::
17015::$$$message_0128_0214_0003$$$::"Please cherish your wife!"[lr]::
17016::$$$message_0128_0214_0004$$$::Her face is bright red, as she swings her arms around.[lr]::
17017::$$$message_0128_0214_0005$$$::The tiger in her is coming out.::
17018::$$$message_0128_0215_0000$$$::"I've never met her before, but...[lr]::
17019::$$$message_0128_0215_0001$$$::I've seen the lunch that you eat at the staffroom before!"::
17020::$$$message_0128_0216_0000$$$::"It wasn't as professionally made as Shirou's, but um, if I were to describe it in one sentence, uh, it was poorly made, or like it's edible...[lr]::
17021::$$$message_0128_0216_0001$$$::But, she tried very hard on it![lr]::
17022::$$$message_0128_0216_0002$$$::I can tell. Since I'm also bad at cooking!"::
17023::$$$message_0128_0217_0000$$$::"Oh, I mean, I'm not trying to remind you that I won't be helpful to you!"::
17024::$$$message_0128_0218_0000$$$::"Besides, I have heard from Shirou, too![lr]::
17025::$$$message_0128_0218_0001$$$::Like the fact that despite being a foreigner, she's trying to get used to her life in Japan and trying very hard! Or how elegant and picturesque you two look together..."[lr]::
17026::$$$message_0128_0218_0002$$$::"Ms. Fujimura. Please sit down.[lr]::
17027::$$$message_0128_0218_0003$$$::You may burn yourself if the tableware tips over."[lr]::
17028::$$$message_0128_0218_0004$$$::"Oh, yes, how rude of m[line len=2]"::
17029::$$$message_0128_0219_0000$$$::Fuji-nee tilts her head in confusion.[lr]::
17030::$$$message_0128_0219_0001$$$::"O... Oh?[lr]::
17031::$$$message_0128_0219_0002$$$::Umm, this isn't some lovey-dovey story where you leave your wife for me...?"[lr]::
17032::$$$message_0128_0219_0003$$$::"No."[lr]::
17033::$$$message_0128_0219_0004$$$::"I'm sorry!"::
17034::$$$message_0128_0220_0000$$$::"O-Oh, okay. Of course.[lr]::
17035::$$$message_0128_0220_0001$$$::Geez, I'm such a reckless person.[lr]::
17036::$$$message_0128_0220_0002$$$::But... Phew, I'm glad."[lr]::
17037::$$$message_0128_0220_0003$$$::"So am I.[lr]::
17038::$$$message_0128_0220_0004$$$::I was not sure how to talk about it. I was talking too much in a roundabout way."::
17039::$$$message_0128_0221_0000$$$::Mr. Kuzuki clasps his hands that were on his knees on the table, his back still straightened.[lr]::
17040::$$$message_0128_0221_0001$$$::A silver ring that subtly glimmers on his ring finger.::
17041::$$$message_0128_0222_0000$$$::"To be honest, I still do not know if I have the words to directly answer your question."[lr]::
17042::$$$message_0128_0222_0001$$$::"Didn't you earlier...?"::
17043::$$$message_0128_0223_0000$$$::"That is how I acted in the past."[lr]::
17044::$$$message_0128_0223_0001$$$::"I-I see."::
17045::$$$message_0128_0224_0000$$$::"Just as your student had pointed out, you may feel anxious about being single.[lr]::
17046::$$$message_0128_0224_0001$$$::Whether or not you can come to terms with yourself while acknowledging your faults, yet continuing to teach. I believe that is what you are concerned about."::
17047::$$$message_0128_0225_0000$$$::"If that is the case, I have the same concerns.[lr]::
17048::$$$message_0128_0225_0001$$$::What I need to do as someone with a wife.[lr]::
17049::$$$message_0128_0225_0002$$$::What others expect from me.[lr]::
17050::$$$message_0128_0225_0003$$$::How I should treat women other than my wife.[lr]::
17051::$$$message_0128_0225_0004$$$::There are many things that I do not know."::
17052::$$$message_0128_0226_0000$$$::"Meeting my wife was the very reason why I started thinking about these things.[lr]::
17053::$$$message_0128_0226_0001$$$::We have no past together.[lr]::
17054::$$$message_0128_0226_0002$$$::We simply had the form of husband and wife in the beginning."::
17055::$$$message_0128_0227_0000$$$::"There is a saying that says 'start with the form,' this is literally that.[lr]::
17056::$$$message_0128_0227_0001$$$::I think now that I was saved by that form. My inner core was flimsy, with nothing to support it."::
17057::$$$message_0128_0228_0000$$$::"But now, you love your wife, right?"[lr]::
17058::$$$message_0128_0228_0001$$$::"..."[lr]::
17059::$$$message_0128_0228_0002$$$::"T-That's where you go quiet?"::
17060::$$$message_0128_0229_0000$$$::"...I am sorry.[lr]::
17061::$$$message_0128_0229_0001$$$::I do not know my own feelings. No, I try not to believe them.[lr]::
17062::$$$message_0128_0229_0002$$$::That is something that should not be done. Therefore, I cannot clearly speak my opinions."::
17063::$$$message_0128_0230_0000$$$::"Huh? Are you not allowed to believe in yourself?"[lr]::
17064::$$$message_0128_0230_0001$$$::"No, this is one of my few beliefs, so do not worry.[lr]::
17065::$$$message_0128_0230_0002$$$::...Well, I have that kind of vow, so I cannot say anything definite, but..."[lr]::
17066::$$$message_0128_0230_0003$$$::Mr. Kuzuki coughs softly.::
17067::$$$message_0128_0231_0000$$$::"...Feelings are dull and idle.[lr]::
17068::$$$message_0128_0231_0001$$$::Even if you feel certain about something right now, it would not be strange for it to change and wither tomorrow."::
17069::$$$message_0128_0232_0000$$$::"That is why perhaps there are feelings that you finally realize from the repetition of everyday life.[lr]::
17070::$$$message_0128_0232_0001$$$::Perhaps there are things that are born from living close together...rather than clinging to a fleeting moment of passion.[lr]::
17071::$$$message_0128_0232_0002$$$::Perhaps even my hollow self would be able to change someday. I thought that."::
17072::$$$message_0128_0233_0000$$$::"If I were to say, that would be weakness.[lr]::
17073::$$$message_0128_0233_0001$$$::If you have nothing to protect, then you have nothing to lose, so you will not lose.[lr]::
17074::$$$message_0128_0233_0002$$$::However, that is merely being alive...[l][say storage=cty0404_kuz_0503 name=葛木]it is no different than being dead."::
17075::$$$message_0128_0234_0000$$$::"Even if we never put it into words, my wife and I are already a married couple.[lr]::
17076::$$$message_0128_0234_0001$$$::I am not skillful, so just continuing to protect our form is the most that I can do now."::
17077::$$$message_0128_0235_0000$$$::"Since I am not talkative, I may appear as though I am collected. However, there are times when I am simply overwhelmed with anxiety in front of the students.[lr]::
17078::$$$message_0128_0235_0001$$$::However, I do not think that is something to be ashamed of if you understand your shortcomings and do your best in the moment..."::
17079::$$$message_0128_0236_0000$$$::"Yes. We must fight until the day that we become respectable teachers, right?"[lr]::
17080::$$$message_0128_0236_0001$$$::"...Well, I suppose it does apply to martial arts too...[lr]::
17081::$$$message_0128_0236_0002$$$::In the short life that we have, I figure that there is no end when it comes to a path of teaching others. [cacheimage storage=藤02b腕B(中)][wvs][chgfg time=300 textoff=0 storage=藤02b腕B(中)][lr]::
17082::$$$message_0128_0236_0003$$$::I believe that restlessly devoting one's self to studies, without drowning in pride, is the correct stance."::
17083::$$$message_0128_0237_0000$$$::"This is all that I can tell you, Ms. Fujimura.[lr]::
17084::$$$message_0128_0237_0001$$$::It may be unpleasant to hear, but I would be happy if it helps keep you from feeling inferior."::
17085::$$$message_0128_0238_0000$$$::And with that, Mr. Kuzuki turns to Fuji-nee and bows his head in thanks.[lr]::
17086::$$$message_0128_0238_0001$$$::Fuji-nee tears up.::
17087::$$$message_0128_0239_0000$$$::"H-How classy! I want to get married![cacheimage storage=藤08d頬(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=藤08d頬(中)] Oh my, er, um."::
17088::$$$message_0128_0240_0000$$$::"Thank you so much.[lr]::
17089::$$$message_0128_0240_0001$$$::You gave me a lot of energy![lr]::
17090::$$$message_0128_0240_0002$$$::I'm rooting for you!"[lr]::
17091::$$$message_0128_0240_0003$$$::Fuji-nee bangs her head onto the table as she bows to him.::
17092::$$$message_0128_0241_0000$$$::"That woman really is funny after all."[lr]::
17093::$$$message_0128_0241_0001$$$::Lancer laughs lightheartedly.[lr]::
17094::$$$message_0128_0241_0002$$$::"As long as she causes a commotion away from Souichirou."[lr]::
17095::$$$message_0128_0241_0003$$$::She's also laughing, but isn't she actually furious?::
17096::$$$message_0128_0242_0000$$$::"Hahaha. Well, I knew that he was a faithful man from the start."[lr]::
17097::$$$message_0128_0242_0001$$$::"...Lancer. Your luck ranking just got updated from an E to an F-."[lr]::
17098::$$$message_0128_0242_0002$$$::"Yeah right. Hahaha."[lr]::
17099::$$$message_0128_0242_0003$$$::"You're paying for the tea. (mumbles) As an inconvenience fee."[lr]::
17100::$$$message_0128_0242_0004$$$::"Hahaha... [cacheimage storage=ランサーギャルソン01i(近)b][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=ランサーギャルソン01i(近)b][shock vmax=20 time=300 count=-3]What?"::
17101::$$$message_0128_0243_0000$$$::We try to leave through the front entrance without being noticed.[lr]::
17102::$$$message_0128_0243_0001$$$::...But that wasn't possible, [se storage=se529.wav]so we discreetly sneak to the restroom, [se storage=se025.wav][se storage=se145.wav]roll out of the narrow window, and our shadowing plan somehow comes to an end.[se storage=se045.wav]::
17103::$$$message_0128_0244_0000$$$::"Looks like I caused you trouble, too."[lr]::
17104::$$$message_0128_0244_0001$$$::She smiles bitterly while dusting off her pants.[lr]::
17105::$$$message_0128_0244_0002$$$::"For real."::
17106::$$$message_0128_0245_0000$$$::"But, I was glad I was able to see Fuji-nee acting like a teacher."[lr]::
17107::$$$message_0128_0245_0001$$$::"You mean that?[cacheimage storage=キャスター私服01g4(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=200][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=キャスター私服01g4(中)] What a troubled person."[lr]::
17108::$$$message_0128_0245_0002$$$::Caster shrugs her shoulders, but she somehow looks satisfied after all.::
17109::$$$message_0128_0246_0000$$$::"Make sure you feed her a lot tonight and make her plump."[lr]::
17110::$$$message_0128_0246_0001$$$::"I will. Don't be too cruel to Issei either... Issei...?"[lr]::
17111::$$$message_0128_0246_0002$$$::"I can't guarantee anything. I'm a witch after all.[lr]::
17112::$$$message_0128_0246_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=キャスター私服02e(中)]...What's wrong? Why do you look so surprised?"::
17113::$$$message_0128_0247_0000$$$::"Damn...[lr]::
17114::$$$message_0128_0247_0001$$$::I completely forgot about Issei..."[lr]::
17115::$$$message_0128_0247_0002$$$::"About meeting up with him? It can't be helped. I'll make up some excuse on my end."[lr]::
17116::$$$message_0128_0247_0003$$$::"Guh... S-Sorry..."[lr]::
17117::$$$message_0128_0247_0004$$$::W-What a disgrace. I've made all the debts that she owes me zero in an instant.::
17118::$$$message_0128_0248_0000$$$::After I see Caster off, I recall Lancer in his waiter outfit.[lr]::
17119::$$$message_0128_0248_0001$$$::Lancer got involved in some trouble early on like this, but he seems like he'll last a while at this part-time job.::
916825::$$$message_9128_0156_0003$$$::Lancer is screaming silently. His earrings are about to rip off. I'm glad I'm not sitting next to her.[r]::�